      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0022",
      "text": "The `query` tool performs hybrid BM25 + semantic search over symbols, with results grouped by `Process` cluster.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0023",
      "text": "The `context` tool provides comprehensive symbol overview — definition, callers, callees, process participation.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0024",
      "text": "The `impact` tool performs blast-radius analysis — upstream/downstream consumers of a symbol with risk scoring.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0025",
      "text": "The `detect_changes` tool maps a git diff onto affected symbols and Process nodes.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0026",
      "text": "The `rename` tool performs multi-file coordinated symbol rename with a `dry_run` option.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
