      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0027",
      "text": "The `cypher` tool provides raw Cypher passthrough to the embedded LadybugDB (formerly KuzuDB) graph store.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-008-gitnexus.md",
